{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119701","id":3736648492,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7euLss","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119701","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119701.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119701.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119701","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119701/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119701/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119701/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ae594ad4dc4be90a90f0262ed8e922589a7d83bb","number":119701,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use `Vector2` for `LabelSettings` Stacked Shadows offset","user":{"login":"Devil-Gaming-Studios","id":78740856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NzQwODU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78740856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios","html_url":"https://github.com/Devil-Gaming-Studios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Devil-Gaming-Studios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #119699\r\n\r\nFixes `StackedShadowData::offset` being stored as `Vector2i` instead of `Vector2`, causing sub-pixel/fractional offset values to be silently truncated when set via the public API which correctly exposes the field as `Vector2`.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`StackedShadowData::offset` was declared as `Vector2i` in `label_settings.h`, but the getter/setter pair (`set_stacked_shadow_offset` / `get_stacked_shadow_offset`) both use `Vector2`. This mismatch meant any fractional component of the offset (e.g. `Vector2(0.5, 1.3)`) was silently lost on assignment due to implicit truncation, while the Inspector continued displaying a `Vector2` field — making the bug very difficult to notice.\r\n\r\nThe fix replaces the two `Vector2i` occurrences in `StackedShadowData` with `Vector2`, aligning the internal storage type with the public API. Existing saved resources are unaffected since whole-number offsets convert identically.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co